      "writtenOn": "2026-07-23T14:55:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But I think it is a problem (or I do not understand something well): if the `pvmfw_load_addr` is set to 4GB-4bytes: it will pass a validation and set the RIP to that address. Next the role of pvmfw is to switch to 64-bit mode, but as it wants to do that it fetches the second instruction which byte past 4GB in 32-bit mode and crashes?",
