      "writtenOn": "2026-07-23T15:07:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, it will crash (with #GP if I recall correctly). We set up an invalid IDT in `pkvm_vcpu_pvmfw_entry_init()`, so we guarantee it is just a DoS?",
