      "writtenOn": "2026-07-23T15:21:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I think so. But it is similar to what this patch tries to prevent `...(even if that would\nonly result in a VM-entry failure, not in a security issue)`, so perhaps extending it about this check is reasonable?",
      "parentUuid": "97c6e481_f5116a19",
      "revId": "a0715e9b40988b7ff0366f713c0923760105d27c",
